# A non-Aura Enchantment ({1}{W}{W}, Story Circle) is castableAsPermanent the
# same as a creature or artifact -- only Aura is excluded (castspell.go's own
# comment on why: it needs a cast-time target this port cannot ask for).
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
queue paygeneric W
# Story Circle's "As Story Circle enters, choose a color" (K:ETBReplacement:
# Other:ChooseColor) runs as it enters (ADR-0022).
queue colorchoice W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
